sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor W as Warehouse Operator / Admin
    participant WFC as WarehouseFulfillmentController
    participant WFS as WarehouseFulfillmentService
    participant O as Order Model
    participant OIA as OrderItemAllocation
    participant D as Delivery Model
    participant N as DomainNotificationDispatcher

    Note over W,N: Step 1: Picking Process
    W->>WFC: POST /warehouse/fulfillment/{order}/pick (pickedItems[])
    WFC->>WFS: pickOrder(order, actor, pickedItems)
    WFS->>O: lockForUpdate() (Assert status in APPROVED/PROCESSING)
    WFS->>OIA: Update status = PICKED, picked_quantity = Qty
    WFS->>O: Update fulfillment_status = PICKED, status = PROCESSING
    WFS-->>WFC: Order Loaded with Allocations & Items

    Note over W,N: Step 2: Packing Process
    W->>WFC: POST /warehouse/fulfillment/{order}/pack (notes)
    WFC->>WFS: packOrder(order, actor, notes)
    WFS->>O: lockForUpdate()
    WFS->>OIA: Update status = PACKED
    WFS->>O: Update fulfillment_status = PACKED
    WFS-->>WFC: Order Ready for Palletization & Dispatch

    Note over W,N: Step 3: Dispatch & Logistics Handover
    W->>WFC: POST /warehouse/fulfillment/{order}/dispatch (scheduled_date, instructions)
    WFC->>WFS: dispatchOrder(order, actor, options)
    WFS->>O: lockForUpdate()
    WFS->>OIA: Update status = DISPATCHED, dispatched_quantity = Qty
    WFS->>O: Update fulfillment_status = DISPATCHED, delivery_status = PENDING_ASSIGNMENT
    WFS->>D: Create Delivery Record (DEL-YYYY-MM-XXXX) & Snapshot DeliveryItems
    WFS->>N: notifyOrderDispatched(order, delivery)
    WFS-->>WFC: Dispatch Completed & Delivery Mission Initialized
